---
title: DeskFlow — Modular Monolith Architecture
---
graph TB
    subgraph Clients
        C[Customer Client]
        A[Agent / Supervisor Client]
        AD[Admin Client]
    end

    subgraph DeskFlow Monolith
        AUTH[Auth Module<br/>JWT · Register · Login · Refresh]
        USER[User Module<br/>Users · AgentProfiles · Roles]
        TICKET[Ticket Module<br/>CRUD · Status Workflow · Events]
        ASSIGN[Assignment Module<br/>Expertise-Match Algorithm]
        NOTIF[Notification Module<br/>In-App · Email · WebSocket]
        SLA[SLA Module<br/>Policies · Deadline Tracker · Scheduler]
        ESC[Escalation Module<br/>EscalationLog · Supervisor Routing]
        ANALYTICS[Analytics Module<br/>Reports · Dashboards]

        SHARED[Shared Kernel<br/>BaseEntity · Events · Security · Exceptions · Utils]
        INFRA[Infrastructure<br/>KafkaProducer · CacheService]
    end

    subgraph External Services
        PG[(PostgreSQL 16)]
        REDIS[(Redis 7)]
        KAFKA[Apache Kafka 3.7]
        MAIL[SMTP / MailHog]
    end

    C -- REST / WS --> AUTH
    A -- REST / WS --> AUTH
    AD -- REST / WS --> AUTH

    AUTH --> USER
    TICKET --> ASSIGN
    TICKET --> SLA
    TICKET --> INFRA
    ASSIGN --> INFRA
    SLA --> INFRA
    ESC --> INFRA

    INFRA --> KAFKA
    KAFKA --> ASSIGN
    KAFKA --> NOTIF
    KAFKA --> ESC
    KAFKA --> ANALYTICS

    NOTIF --> MAIL
    NOTIF --> REDIS

    AUTH --> REDIS
    ANALYTICS --> REDIS

    TICKET --> PG
    USER --> PG
    ASSIGN --> PG
    NOTIF --> PG
    SLA --> PG
    ESC --> PG
    ANALYTICS --> PG

    AUTH -.-> SHARED
    TICKET -.-> SHARED
    ASSIGN -.-> SHARED
    NOTIF -.-> SHARED
    SLA -.-> SHARED
    ESC -.-> SHARED
    ANALYTICS -.-> SHARED